What this license covers
------------------------

The following first-party creative assets, wherever they appear in this
repository (today mostly inside js/data.js, js/apps/*.js, js/icons.js,
js/main.js, js/sound.js, css/style.css and home.html; later also data/*.json):

  1. Indonesian (and English) UI copy: labels, dialog text, balloon tips,
